  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU support to the Civil Society Resource Center - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;global objective&lt;/strong&gt; of this direct award procedure is to provide further support for the countrywide operations of the Resource Centre for civil society in North Macedonia (RC), as a platform for civil society at the local, national and regional level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objective &lt;/strong&gt;of this direct award procedure is to build the capacity of CSOs to be professional, credible, effective and accountable independent actors.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
